  "description": "Frisk is the compact member of the Escapade series. A Blue frame with colourful pole tops holds a rope net platform, climbing poles, seats and a slide, all within a product area of 20' x 10'. The safe play area is 26' x 16', so Frisk fits a smaller society garden, a clubhouse lawn or a preschool. It takes 15 to 20 children. Children climb the poles, rest on the net platform and slide down, and the seats give a spot to sit between turns. Listed skills include emotional intelligence, leadership and self-directed play. We cover the galvanised frame, the moulded slide, the laminates and the rope net for 3 years. Call +91 902 830 2266 and we will check the fit.",
